        "✅ Integration test: Sequential loop in online mode",
        "✅ Integration test: Sequential loop in batch mode",
        "✅ Parity test: Compare online vs batch outputs (must be identical)",
        "✅ Error test: Batch iteration failure blocks subsequent iterations"
      ]
    },

